          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye akamwambia, “Baba, kama umemwapia Mwenyezi-Mungu kitu, basi nitendee kama ulivyoahidi, kwa vile sasa amekuwezesha kuwalipiza kisasi adui zako Waamoni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, akamwambia baba yake, “Nakuomba jambo hili moja, nipatie muda wa miezi miwili, niende na rafiki zangu milimani, niomboleze kufariki kwangu kabla ya kuolewa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baba yake akamruhusu aende huko kwa miezi miwili. Naye akaenda pamoja na rafiki zake, wakaomboleza kufa kwake kabla ya kuolewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya miezi miwili akarudi nyumbani; kisha baba yake akamtendea kulingana na nadhiri yake. Msichana huyo hakuwa amemjua mwanamume yeyote. Basi, tangu wakati huo kukawa na desturi hii katika Israeli: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila mwaka wanawake wa Israeli huenda kuomboleza kwa siku nne kifo cha bintiye Yeftha wa Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
